      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">제목<input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"설계 문서 초안 작성\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#5b6270);}.ds-input{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);display:block;width:100%;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 11px;caret-color:var(--blue,#2b55d6);}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "활성 메뉴",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "오늘·계획·보관함·설정 탐색. 로고와 오늘은 실제 오늘로 이동.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\" aria-label=\"주 메뉴\"><button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M9 9v12M15 9v12M3 15h18\"/></svg><span>계획</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{background:var(--text,#1b1e23);padding:18px 8px;width:max-content;}.ds-nav{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;min-height:34px;background:var(--blue,#2b55d6);color:var(--surface,#fff);border:0;width:56px;min-height:54px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;padding:7px 3px;}.ds-nav svg{width:20px;height:20px;}.ds-nav span{font-size:11px;}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--blue,#2b55d6);}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "패널",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "목록·시간표·설정의 평면 구획.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>시간표</h2><p>시간을 정하고 오늘 할 일을 확인하세요.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:10px;padding:20px;}.ds-panel h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0;}.ds-panel p{color:var(--muted,#5b6270);line-height:1.7;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "기간 선택",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "period-selected",
      "description": "주: 시간 격자, 2주: 제목, 월: 작업량.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-period\" aria-label=\"계획 기간\"><button aria-pressed=\"false\">주</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">2주</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\">월</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-period{display:flex;border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;width:max-content;}.ds-period button{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;min-height:34px;border:0;border-radius:0;min-width:48px;}.ds-period button:hover{background:var(--control-hover,#f0f3fa);}.ds-period [aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--blue,#2b55d6);color:var(--surface,#fff);}.ds-period button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;outline-offset:-2px;}"
    },
    {
