      "description": "소요시간에 비례하는 작업, 예시는 90분.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-block\"><button class=\"ds-title\"><span>설계 문서 초안 작성</span><small>13:00–14:30 · 1시간 30분</small></button><div class=\"ds-resize\" role=\"separator\" aria-label=\"소요시간 조절\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" aria-valuemin=\"15\" aria-valuemax=\"1440\" aria-valuenow=\"90\" aria-valuetext=\"90분\" tabindex=\"0\"></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-block{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);position:relative;background:var(--blue-soft,#e3eafb);border:1px solid var(--blue-soft,#e3eafb);border-radius:6px;height:108px;min-height:12px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-title{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);border:0;background:transparent;width:100%;height:100%;padding:4px 8px;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;}.ds-title span{overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-title small{font-size:11px;}.ds-title:hover{background:var(--blue-soft,#e3eafb);}.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;outline-offset:-2px;}.ds-resize{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:12px;opacity:0;cursor:ns-resize;touch-action:none;}.ds-resize:after{content:\"\";display:block;width:26px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--blue,#2b55d6);margin:3px auto;}.ds-block:hover .ds-resize,.ds-resize:focus-visible{opacity:1;}.ds-resize:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;outline-offset:-2px;}"
    },
