      "description": "월간 작업량과 여유시간.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-day\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-number\">9 <small>오늘</small></span><small>2건 · 2시간</small><span class=\"ds-capacity\"><i></i></span><small>여유 6시간</small></button>",
      "css": ".ds-day{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--text,#1b1e23);cursor:pointer;background:var(--surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--border,#d9dce1);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;min-height:34px;border:0;min-height:92px;padding:8px 6px;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;background:var(--selected-surface,#f4f7fe);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--blue,#2b55d6);}.ds-number{font-size:13px;color:var(--blue,#2b55d6);font-weight:700;}.ds-day small{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#5b6270);font-weight:400;}.ds-capacity{margin-top:auto;height:6px;background:var(--line,#e4e6ea);width:100%;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;}.ds-capacity i{display:block;height:100%;width:25%;background:var(--blue,#2b55d6);}.ds-day:hover{background:var(--selected-surface,#f4f7fe);}.ds-day:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#2b55d6);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
